OL,3,GNEWSATrial of free diplomas for
OL,4,Apotential youth workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FVocational courses that usually cost
OL,7,Fmore than #2,000 are being offered free
OL,8,Ffor adults who would like to work with
OL,9,Fchildren and young people.
OL,11,FThe "free access" pilot for Level 3
OL,12,FDiplomas would be trialled from
OL,13,FSeptember, The Guernsey Institute (TGI)
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FThe Level 3 qualifications - broadly
OL,17,Fequivalent to A Levels or advanced
OL,18,Fapprenticeships - will be offered to
OL,19,Fadults who do not currently hold one as
OL,20,Fpart of a trial.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
