OL,3,GNEWSATrial of free diplomas for
OL,4,Apotential youth workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FLouise Misselke, TGI College principal,
OL,7,Fsaid the pilot marked a "significant
OL,8,Finvestment" in the island's workforce:
OL,9,F"For some people, cost has been the one
OL,10,Fthing standing between them and a
OL,11,Fcareer they'd genuinely love to
OL,12,Fpursue."
